68
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,700
This is an important office word.

69
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:36,580
This means to be offered a better job in your company.

70
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:37,800
That means to move up.

71
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:38,580
To move up.

72
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:39,580
Right.

73
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,200
