190
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,600
Right.

191
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,000
I'm surprised.

192
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,300
So it's a way to express surprise.

193
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:12,200
That's right.

194
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,880
