197
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:20,760
Huh?

198
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:22,640
Okay.

199
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:23,640
That means no.

200
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,640
Okay.

201
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,640
Okay.

202
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,640
No way.

203
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,640
That means no.

204
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:31,920
But also if you say it like, no way, you're saying, wow, that's so interesting.

205
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:38,680
So it can be an expression of surprise or it can be a way of saying no, very firmly, no way.

206
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:39,680
Exactly.

207
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:40,680
All right.

